# ESLint bulk-suppressions tooling regenerates this as an empty `{}` for a
# workspace with nothing to suppress, and committing/deleting it is an endless
# loop. @lcabrera/eslint-plugin is public-facing and suppression-free by
# construction (AGENTS.md §4) — CI checks out no file, so any real finding fails
# the gate. Never un-ignore this or commit a non-empty one.
#
# It carries a second weight here: these ARE the custom rules. A suppression in
# this package would be the rule author exempting themselves from the rule.
eslint-suppressions.json
